OL,3,GNEWSAExtra support for early prison
OL,4,Arelease victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnhanced emotional support has been
OL,7,Fmade available for Cambridgeshire-based
OL,8,Fvictims affected by the government's
OL,9,Fearly prison release scheme.
OL,11,FHundreds of criminals left prisons in
OL,12,FEngland and Wales in October in an
OL,13,Fattempt to reduce prison overcrowding,
OL,14,Fand thousands more are due to be
OL,15,Freleased.
OL,17,FA report by the office of
OL,18,FCambridgeshire's police and crime
OL,19,Fcommissioner (OPCC) said it was using
OL,20,Falmost #200,000 of new funding from the
OL,21,FMinistry of Justice to support affected
OL,22,Fvictims.
